#: .\podcasts\templates\podcasts\signup.html:214
#: .\podcasts\templates\socialaccount\signup.html:115
msgid ""
"To keep our services free and advertisement-free, Muse Podcast, LLC may sell"
" aggregated, anonymized data analytics to podcast creators, business "
"partners, or other third parties. We ensure your privacy by anonymizing "
"data, meaning your personal identifiable information (like your name or "
"exact contact details) will never be sold or shared. Your identity is "
"replaced by a unique, randomized number to maintain your anonymity."
